# `drip:` namespace

- `drip:` scopes a message to the DRIP app; the prefix is optional — DRIP concepts (`.p`, `i-N`, `f-N`, `.d.txt`, KB) imply DRIP scope too.
- `drip:` is a scope marker, not a tool name or a Cursor `@` / `/` / `#` reference.
